==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|drykkr||a drink|lang=non}} from the {{proto|lang=non|Germanic|drunkiz}}, whence also Old English {{term|drync|lang=ang}} and Old High German {{term|trunch}}. Cognate with the Swedish {{term|dryck|lang=sv}}.

